WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.650
- I last saw you when you
presented at the Billboard Awards

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:05.100
and, so you knew something
happened to me and

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.270
I had no idea it was happening.

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:07.430
- Well, that's a live show, right?

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:08.263
- Yes.

00:00:08.263 --> 00:00:09.096
- Okay, so.

00:00:09.096 --> 00:00:09.929
- Very, do you know
how many quick changes?

00:00:09.929 --> 00:00:10.762
Oh my God.

00:00:10.762 --> 00:00:11.595
- Well, I do and this kinda,

00:00:11.595 --> 00:00:12.590
the story kinda goes along with that.

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:13.423
- Yeah.

00:00:13.423 --> 00:00:15.184
- So they've got her just
a little, sort of context.

00:00:15.184 --> 00:00:16.600
She's hosting the show,

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.080
and they've got her,
you know, I mean running

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:19.913
back and forth, back and forth.

00:00:19.913 --> 00:00:21.010
- Yes.
- There's no time to stop.

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:22.170
You are like a freight train, man.

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:23.003
It's like coming and going.

00:00:23.003 --> 00:00:24.560
- I feel like Reba in the
nineties with all the changes.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:25.393
- It's unreal.

00:00:25.393 --> 00:00:26.226
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:27.330
- But I'm standing there
and you're coming through,

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:28.920
and you've got this train on your dress.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:29.753
- Yes.

00:00:29.753 --> 00:00:30.710
- And you're flying by,

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.250
and there's this dude that just kinda,

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:33.250
he just...

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.083
Do we have the technology?

00:00:34.083 --> 00:00:35.423
Can I stand?

00:00:35.423 --> 00:00:36.689
(Kelly laughing and clapping)

00:00:36.689 --> 00:00:37.720
He just stands like this
and he starts talking

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.440
to someone, and he stands on your dress.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.610
And you're flying by.
- Ohhhhh.

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:43.486
- I mean (slaps hands
together) you're like a shot.

00:00:43.486 --> 00:00:44.647
- Well, that would've been quite.

00:00:44.647 --> 00:00:45.960
- It would've been a different show.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:46.870
- Yeah.

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:48.520
It would've been brought
to you by Spanx and hoes.

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.050
- That's right, that's right.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:51.311
- Yeah, ha ha.

00:00:51.311 --> 00:00:52.311
- And I just looked at him.

00:00:52.311 --> 00:00:53.144
I didn't know the guy,

00:00:53.144 --> 00:00:54.190
but we just connected
somehow and made eye contact.

00:00:54.190 --> 00:00:55.387
It was a dude thing, and I was like,

00:00:55.387 --> 00:00:56.500
"raise your right foot."

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:57.620
And he literally just went like this,

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:58.670
he looked at me and he goes, "whoop."

00:00:58.670 --> 00:00:59.720
And he raised his right and you "boop,"

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:00.553
and you were gone.

00:01:00.553 --> 00:01:01.580
- Oh my gosh!
- Yeah.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.360
- Literally, that would have
been like a very different

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:05.651
version of "Single Ladies."

00:01:05.651 --> 00:01:06.790
(audience laughing)

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:07.989
That whole, that whole look would've been.

00:01:07.989 --> 00:01:10.520
Thank you from the bottom of my heart.

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:11.353
- You're very welcome, anytime.

00:01:11.353 --> 00:01:12.730
- 'Cause we are racing in and out of there

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:14.093
and stuff like that happens all the time.

00:01:14.093 --> 00:01:14.926
so thank you.

00:01:14.926 --> 00:01:16.076
- Yeah, you're welcome.

